  "description": "A small, dependency-free C# library for Roman numerals: conversion to/from Arabic integers (1–3999), arithmetic, comparison, and lenient/strict parsing. Immutable and allocation-light.",
  "id": "Roman",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-24T08:24:20.243Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
